---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="How Herb-All handles browsing and contact enquiries."
>
  <header class="container page-heading">
    <p class="eyebrow">Herb-All · Good to know</p>
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
  </header>
  <section class="container">
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="sample-note">
        Starter copy requiring owner and legal review before commercial launch.
        This is not a jurisdiction-specific legal document.
      </p>
      <h2>Browsing this website</h2>
      <p>
        Herb-All does not currently use analytics, advertising cookies, customer
        accounts. Guest checkout stores order contact details, delivery
        information and payment evidence in the commerce database. The website
        host may process technical request information, such as IP addresses and
        server logs, to deliver and protect the site. The owner must confirm the
        chosen hosting provider’s policies before launch.
      </p>
      <h2>Shopping and order records</h2>
      <p>
        The cart uses browser local storage. Private tracking credentials are
        remembered in session storage for the current browser tab. Administrator
        sessions use an HttpOnly session cookie. Order records include your
        contact and destination details, product and price snapshots, payment
        references, optional private receipt images and operational history.
        Authorized staff use these to process your order.
      </p>
      <p>
        If Google Routes is configured, a delivery address is sent to Google for
        a road-distance estimate. If email notifications are configured, contact
        details and order updates are sent through the configured email
        provider. Your payment PIN is never requested. Receipt submission does
        not grant the website access to your M-Pesa account.
      </p>
      <h2>Contacting us</h2>
      <p>
        {site.netlifyFormEnabled
          ? 'The contact form submits your name, email address and message to Netlify Forms for Herb-All to review. Netlify processes and stores the submission. Do not send sensitive health information.'
          : 'The enquiry form creates an email in your own email application. It does not submit to a website backend.'}{' '}
        When you send an email or contact us by telephone or WhatsApp, the
        relevant service processes that communication and Herb-All receives the
        details you choose to share.
      </p>
      <h2>Information you share</h2>
      <p>
        Do not send medical records or sensitive health information. The owner
        must confirm retention periods, contact details, applicable rights and
        the process for privacy requests before commercial launch.
      </p>
      <h2>External services</h2>
      <p>
        Linked social platforms have their own privacy policies. No analytics or
        advertising scripts are installed.
      </p>
      <p>
        For privacy questions, <a href="/contact/">contact Herb-All</a> when the
        direct contact details become available.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
